{# Compact editor toggle group in the TOP bar next to the zoom controls
   (shared by the single-variant and the group editor). The element IDs are
   load-bearing: canvas_floating_toolbar (#highlight-editable-control +
   #caption-visible-control), canvas_container (#container-zones-control),
   canvas_snapping (#snap-enabled-control on connect) and canvas_rulers
   (#ruler-enabled-control) key off them. Both editor roots wrap the header,
   so the data-actions reach the same controllers as before the move. #}
<div class="d-inline-block align-middle ms-3">
    <div class="form-check form-switch form-check-inline my-0 me-3 align-middle">
        <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" role="switch" id="highlight-editable-control" checked data-action="change->canvas-floating-toolbar#toggleHighlight">
        <label class="form-check-label small" for="highlight-editable-control">Zobrazit editovatelné prvky</label>
    </div>
    {# Independent of the outline switch above: the two draw different halves of
       the same overlay, and a designer reviewing the composition usually wants
       the frames without the name tags covering the top of every element. #}
    <div class="form-check form-switch form-check-inline my-0 me-3 align-middle">
        <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" role="switch" id="caption-visible-control" checked data-action="change->canvas-floating-toolbar#toggleCaptions">
        <label class="form-check-label small" for="caption-visible-control" title="Jmenovky polí zobrazené v rohu každého editovatelného prvku">Popisky prvků</label>
    </div>
    {# Chrome only — hiding the frames never touches the container DEFINITIONS
       (they keep reflowing the design and stay listed in the Kontejnery panel). #}
    <div class="form-check form-switch form-check-inline my-0 me-3 align-middle">
        <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" role="switch" id="container-zones-control" checked data-action="change->canvas-container#toggleZones">
        <label class="form-check-label small" for="container-zones-control" title="Přerušované rámečky kontejnerů na plátně. Kontejnery zůstávají funkční, jen je nevidíte.">Rámečky kontejnerů</label>
    </div>
    <div class="form-check form-switch form-check-inline my-0 me-3 align-middle">
        <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" role="switch" id="snap-enabled-control" checked data-action="change->canvas-snapping#toggleSnapping">
        <label class="form-check-label small" for="snap-enabled-control">Přichytávání k prvkům <span class="text-muted">(⌘ = vypnout)</span></label>
    </div>
    <div class="form-check form-switch form-check-inline my-0 me-3 align-middle">
        <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" role="switch" id="ruler-enabled-control" checked data-action="change->canvas-rulers#toggle">
        <label class="form-check-label small" for="ruler-enabled-control">Pravítka a vodítka</label>
    </div>
    {# Pointer-modifier cheatsheet — a modal rather than a line under the
       canvas, which cost the stage vertical space on every screen. The modal
       lives in the shared stage partial (#editorHelpModal). #}
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary align-middle" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#editorHelpModal" title="Nápověda k ovládání plátna"><i class="mdi mdi-help-circle-outline me-1"></i>Nápověda</button>
</div>
